export function ip(s){if(typeof s!=='string'||! /^(0|[1-9]\d{0,2})(\.(0|[1-9]\d{0,2})){3}$/.test(s))throw Error('Use four decimal octets without leading zeros.');let a=s.split('.').map(Number);if(a.some(n=>n>255))throw Error('IPv4 octets must be 0–255.');return a.reduce((n,v)=>n*256+v,0)}
export function addr(n){return [24,16,8,0].map(b=>Math.floor(n/2**b)%256).join('.')}
export function subnet(c){if(typeof c!=='string'||! /^.+\/(0|[1-9]\d?)$/.test(c))throw Error('Expected IPv4/prefix.');let [a,p]=c.split('/');p=Number(p);if(p>32)throw Error('Prefix must be 0–32.');let v=ip(a),size=2**(32-p),start=Math.floor(v/size)*size;return {p,size,start,end:start+size-1,mask:addr(2**32-size),cidr:addr(start)+'/'+p,aligned:start===v,usable:p<31?size-2:size}}
export function envelope(a){let n=subnet(a.cidr);return a.growthPrefix===undefined?n:subnet(addr(n.start)+'/'+a.growthPrefix)}
export function validate(p){let errors=[];try{if(p.version!==1||typeof p.name!=='string'||!Array.isArray(p.pools)||!p.pools.length||p.pools.length>32)throw Error('Use version 1, a name, and 1–32 pools.');let ids=new Set(),roots=[];for(let pool of p.pools){if(typeof pool.id!=='string'||!pool.id||ids.has(pool.id)||typeof pool.name!=='string')throw Error('Pool IDs must be unique; names are required.');ids.add(pool.id);let root=subnet(pool.cidr);if(!root.aligned)throw Error(pool.name+': pool is not aligned.');if(roots.some(n=>root.start<=n.end&&n.start<=root.end))throw Error('Pools overlap.');roots.push(root);if(!Array.isArray(pool.allocations)||pool.allocations.length>256)throw Error('Each pool needs an allocations array (maximum 256).');let used=[];for(let a of pool.allocations){if(typeof a.id!=='string'||!a.id||ids.has(a.id)||typeof a.name!=='string'||typeof a.location!=='string'||!['active','reserved'].includes(a.status))throw Error('Allocation needs unique id, name, location and active/reserved status.');ids.add(a.id);let n=subnet(a.cidr);if(!n.aligned)throw Error(a.name+': use aligned prefix '+n.cidr);if(!Number.isInteger(a.requiredHosts)||a.requiredHosts<0||a.requiredHosts>n.usable)throw Error(a.name+': host demand exceeds capacity or is invalid.');if(a.growthPrefix!==undefined&&(!Number.isInteger(a.growthPrefix)||a.growthPrefix!==n.p-1||a.status!=='active'))throw Error(a.name+': growthPrefix must be exactly one less than active prefix.');let e=envelope(a);if(e.start!==n.start)throw Error(a.name+': active block must be the first half of its growth envelope.');if(e.start<root.start||e.end>root.end)throw Error(a.name+': allocation or reservation is outside its pool.');if(used.some(x=>e.start<=x.end&&x.start<=e.end))throw Error(a.name+': overlaps another allocation or growth reservation.');used.push(e)}}if(p.campus){let c=subnet(p.campus.cidr);if(!c.aligned||!Array.isArray(p.campus.poolIds))throw Error('Invalid campus container.');for(let id of p.campus.poolIds){let pool=p.pools.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!pool)throw Error('Unknown campus pool ID.');let n=subnet(pool.cidr);if(n.start<c.start||n.end>c.end)throw Error('Pool outside campus container.')}}if(p.sourceNotes!==undefined&&(!Array.isArray(p.sourceNotes)||p.sourceNotes.some(x=>typeof x!=='string')))throw Error('sourceNotes must be text entries.')}catch(e){errors.push(e.message)}return errors}
export function segments(pool){let out=[],root=subnet(pool.cidr),cursor=root.start;for(let a of [...pool.allocations].sort((a,b)=>subnet(a.cidr).start-subnet(b.cidr).start)){let n=subnet(a.cidr),e=envelope(a);if(n.start>cursor)out.push({start:cursor,end:n.start-1,status:'free',name:'Unallocated'});out.push({...n,...a});if(e.end>n.end)out.push({start:n.end+1,end:e.end,status:'growth',name:'Reserved for '+a.name,cidr:addr(n.end+1)+'/'+n.p,owner:a.id});cursor=e.end+1}if(cursor<=root.end)out.push({start:cursor,end:root.end,status:'free',name:'Unallocated'});return out}
